    txt-connector:modellingNote "Repair can extend the usable lifetime of a textile product. Product lifetime indicators are represented in TEXTILE_INDICATOR, and any formal link should be handled there or in a cross-module relation layer."@en, "This class represents a repair activity or process type. Repairability capability, repair service information and repairability assessment belong to Textile Repairability."@en;
    txt-connector:sourceLocator "JRC Preparatory Study, Section 9.2.3.2, printed page 129, lines 3466-3476; JRC Preparatory Study, Section 9.2.3.3, printed pages 129-130, lines 3477-3484; JRC Preparatory Study, Section 13.10.1.5, printed pages 473-474, lines 11273-11326."@en;
    txt-connector:sourceType txt-connector:adaptedDefinition;
    rdfs:subClassOf txt-process:MaintenanceAndRepairProcess.
