    txt-connector:modellingNote "Dimensional stability contributes to the interpretation of intrinsic durability; loss of dimensional stability is the corresponding failure expression."@en, "Dimensional stability is the performance parameter; loss of dimensional stability is the corresponding failure expression."@en;
