    txt-connector:sourceLocator "JRC Preparatory Study, Section 3.3.1, printed pages 27, 29, lines 536-547; JRC Preparatory Study, Section 9.2.1.1, printed page 110, lines 2889-2910; JRC Preparatory Study, Section 3.3.1, Table 8, printed page 27; caption line 546."@en;
