    rdfs:comment "A process target or input specification stating the yarn count or yarn linear-density class selected for fabric manufacturing."@en;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-process>;
    txt-connector:modellingNote "The JRC identifies yarn count as one of the weaving parameters affecting fabric characteristics. The exact target characteristic depends on fabric construction, yarn type and end use; therefore only weak influence annotations are used."@en, "The process-side target remains distinct from the resulting characteristic represented in Textile Structure."@en, "Yarn count is identified by the JRC as a fabric manufacturing parameter affecting fabric characteristics. A broad weak influence target is used here because the specific effect depends on yarn type, fabric construction and end use."@en;
    txt-connector:sourceLocator "JRC Preparatory Study, Section 13.10.2, printed pages 493-495, lines 11902-11920; JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, Table 182, printed page 302; caption line 9114."@en;
