    rdfs:comment "Process producing a new textile product from waste objects, products or components, with at least one change that may affect performance, purpose or type. It is distinct from material recycling."@en;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-repairability>;
    txt-connector:sourceLocator "JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, printed pages 16-17, lines 222-225; JRC Preparatory Study, Section 13.10.1.13, printed pages 480-481, lines 11645-11673; JRC Preparatory Study, relevant section, Table 2, printed page 15; caption line 219."@en;
